00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:04.560
Then sell the 30-deltacall expiring in 30-45 days

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:08.080
on platforms such as Questrade or Interactive Brokers.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.580
The approach has historically delivered

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.260
