00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:18.560
when realized volatility exceeds implied volatility

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.100
by at least three points.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.800
The main risk is capping upside during sharp rallies

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:28.040
so position size should stay below 15% of the TFSA.

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.780
This setup works best when you already hold the ETF

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:34.260
and simply layer the call sale on top.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.820
You would run the screen once a month

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.660
and let the premium offset any modest downside.

